{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Western Justice</strong> tells the story of a newly appointed sheriff assigned to a lawless frontier town. The player must bring order to the chaos by taking down outlaws while overseeing the rebuilding and development of the town. The narrative unfolds through a mix of justice, conflict, and tough decisions that shape both the sheriff\u2019s path and the town\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/dab5a631387d0f70b1216799b10f0dde.poster.avif?t=1759832975\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/dab5a631387d0f70b1216799b10f0dde.webm?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/dab5a631387d0f70b1216799b10f0dde.mp4?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town Development and Sheriff Systems:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Western Justice is more than just action. The player constructs new buildings to expand and improve the town's infrastructure, customize the sheriff's office with unique decorations, and build relationships with townsfolk to earn reputation. A strong reputation unlocks new guns, customization items, various perks, and influences how citizens react. Additionally, activities like horse races and table games add variety and replayability. Character progression is driven by the choices made throughout the game, ensuring each playthrough feels distinct.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A TRUE WILD WEST SHERIFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/b1c35a218d4c1c6f8423b732358fabbe.poster.avif?t=1759832975\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/b1c35a218d4c1c6f8423b732358fabbe.webm?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/b1c35a218d4c1c6f8423b732358fabbe.mp4?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Action Mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player enforces the law through real-time shootouts, hand-to-hand combat, and reflex-based duel sequences. A <strong>lasso mechanic</strong> allows the sheriff to capture criminals alive, adding a tactical element to gameplay. Each encounter tests the player\u2019s skills and is supported by cinematic moments that immerse the player in an authentic Wild West atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612910?t=1759832975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612910?t=1759832975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/f52a8165f5c77af581c57ff312946d36881b275d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759832975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/f52a8165f5c77af581c57ff312946d36881b275d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759832975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is no sexual content or drug use in our game. However, there are instances of blood shown in combat scenes. Additionally, some items (such as bottles and beer) feature alcohol-related content. These elements are included to enhance the atmosphere of the game alongside violent scenes. We want to ensure that players are aware of such content, as it may be sensitive to some."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Western Justice</strong> tells the story of a newly appointed sheriff assigned to a lawless frontier town. The player must bring order to the chaos by taking down outlaws while overseeing the rebuilding and development of the town. The narrative unfolds through a mix of justice, conflict, and tough decisions that shape both the sheriff\u2019s path and the town\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/dab5a631387d0f70b1216799b10f0dde.poster.avif?t=1759832975\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/dab5a631387d0f70b1216799b10f0dde.webm?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/dab5a631387d0f70b1216799b10f0dde.mp4?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Town Development and Sheriff Systems:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Western Justice is more than just action. The player constructs new buildings to expand and improve the town's infrastructure, customize the sheriff's office with unique decorations, and build relationships with townsfolk to earn reputation. A strong reputation unlocks new guns, customization items, various perks, and influences how citizens react. Additionally, activities like horse races and table games add variety and replayability. Character progression is driven by the choices made throughout the game, ensuring each playthrough feels distinct.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A TRUE WILD WEST SHERIFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/b1c35a218d4c1c6f8423b732358fabbe.poster.avif?t=1759832975\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/b1c35a218d4c1c6f8423b732358fabbe.webm?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/extras/b1c35a218d4c1c6f8423b732358fabbe.mp4?t=1759832975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Action Mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player enforces the law through real-time shootouts, hand-to-hand combat, and reflex-based duel sequences. A <strong>lasso mechanic</strong> allows the sheriff to capture criminals alive, adding a tactical element to gameplay. Each encounter tests the player\u2019s skills and is supported by cinematic moments that immerse the player in an authentic Wild West atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bearstrike Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/d3919f727674b3ac041d0e4f147556a17f2c3cd7/header.jpg?t=1759832975","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>