136f35488b8760b49/ss_70f2d19cb41d6c4bfb64cb4136f35488b8760b49.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759832975","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612910/70f2d19cb41d6c4bfb64cb4136f35488b8760b49/ss_70f2d19cb41d6c4bfb64cb4136f35488b8760b49.600x338.jpg?t=1759832975"}],"short_description":"Western Justice is an action simulation game combining wild west shootouts, town-building, community management, deputy assignment, and prison management. Become a sheriff, bring justice to lawless lands, save your townsfolk from gangs, and build a safe civilization in the old west.","steam_appid":3612910,"support_info":{"email":"bearstrikegamesco@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}